desc:
Almost brand new 1 BED 1 BATH walk out suite in Vancouver (W 44 Ave/Blenheim) on quiet dead end tree lined street with ample parking.

Be only the second person to live in this light and bright beautiful suite in a modern home with black plumbing fixtures and hardware!

Some of the many features include:

- Separate entrance with covered private patio;
- Radiant heat laminate floors;
- Unbeatable location within close proximity to great amenities and great schools plus transit/UBC;
- High ceilings;
- Lots of natural light;
- Sound proof insulation for noise prevention;
- Stainless steel kitchen appliances + dishwasher; and,
- Separate laundry with brand new side by side washer and drawer.
- EV Charging for vehicles. 

Preference will be given to long term lease (minimum one year). Sorry no smoking (small pets okay). Asking $2,300 including utilities and wifi internet.

Please call Gary to arrange a showing at  show contact info
. Text for a faster response. Available immediately and will not last! Owner will be living upstairs and will only rent to qualified tenants with excellent references.
